{"seq":2,"slug":"targeting-lock-on","title":"锁定与目标选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/systems-depth/targeting-lock-on","wordCount":1454,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"锁定与目标选择\">锁定与目标选择</h1><p>在 2D 平面上「打谁」几乎不是问题——敌人就在你左边或右边。一旦进入 3D 空间，玩家立刻要同时操心三件事：移动、转视角、对准敌人。如果还要求玩家手动把准星精确叠到乱跑的敌人身上，战斗就变成了和摄像机的搏斗。锁定（lock-on）系统把「打谁」这件事从玩家手里接管过来，让玩家把注意力还给战斗本身。这一篇解决 3D 战斗特有的目标选择与镜头协同，它决定了你的<a href=\"../hit-resolution/hitbox-hurtbox-systems\">攻击框</a>和<a href=\"combo-system-design\">连段</a>究竟送向哪个敌人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-软锁定与硬锁定\">核心概念：软锁定与硬锁定</h2><p>目标辅助大体分两类，分别对应不同的设计取向。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[玩家发起攻击/进入战斗] --&gt; B{锁定模式}&#10;  B --&gt;|软锁定 Soft| C[每次出招时&lt;br/&gt;自动选最优目标]&#10;  B --&gt;|硬锁定 Hard| D[锁定单一目标&lt;br/&gt;镜头持续追踪]&#10;  C --&gt; E[攻击自动转向该目标]&#10;  D --&gt; F[移动变为环绕&lt;br/&gt;右摇杆切换目标]&#10;  E --&gt; G[攻击命中]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[玩家发起攻击/进入战斗] --&gt; B{锁定模式}\n  B --&gt;|软锁定 Soft| C[每次出招时&lt;br/&gt;自动选最优目标]\n  B --&gt;|硬锁定 Hard| D[锁定单一目标&lt;br/&gt;镜头持续追踪]\n  C --&gt; E[攻击自动转向该目标]\n  D --&gt; F[移动变为环绕&lt;br/&gt;右摇杆切换目标]\n  E --&gt; G[攻击命中]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><ul>\n<li>软锁定（soft lock）：玩家不显式锁定，系统在每次出招的瞬间，自动把攻击导向「最该打」的那个目标（最近、镜头朝向内、生命最低等）。玩家几乎无感，自由度高，常见于动作游戏。</li>\n<li>硬锁定（hard lock）：玩家按键锁定一个目标，镜头持续把它框在屏幕中央，角色移动变成围绕目标环绕。掌控感强、对单清晰，是 3D 动作 RPG 的标配。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>软锁定</th>\n<th>硬锁定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>玩家操作</td>\n<td>无需显式锁定</td>\n<td>需按键锁定/切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镜头</td>\n<td>自由</td>\n<td>持续追踪目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多敌处理</td>\n<td>灵活、不黏单一目标</td>\n<td>清晰、但易忽略其他敌人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适配品类</td>\n<td>鬼泣式群战、割草</td>\n<td>魂系单挑、刺客潜行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"目标评分-到底该打谁\">目标评分：到底该打谁</h2><p>无论软硬锁定，「自动选目标」的核心都是给每个候选目标打分，取最高分者。一个实用的评分函数综合距离、视角偏角、可见性等因子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(t) = w_d \\cdot \\frac{1}{d(t)} + w_a \\cdot \\cos\\theta(t) + w_v \\cdot V(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是到目标的距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标相对玩家朝向（或镜头朝向、或右摇杆推动方向）的夹角，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是可见性（被墙挡住则趋零），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是各项权重。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 让「正前方」的目标得分高、「背后」的趋负，符合直觉。</p>\n<p>这套评分要逐帧或逐次出招重算，且权重配比极讲究：太偏距离会「黏」在脚边小怪上而忽略真正威胁，太偏视角又会在玩家微调镜头时频繁跳目标。评分函数往往是锁定手感调试里改得最多的一段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标切换与镜头协同\">目标切换与镜头协同</h2><p>硬锁定下，玩家要能顺畅地在多个敌人间切换。主流做法是按右摇杆的推动方向选择「该方向上最近的下一个目标」，而非简单按距离轮换——这让切换符合空间直觉。切换时还需处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>防抖：避免两个目标得分接近时镜头来回横跳，常加滞回（hysteresis）阈值。</li>\n<li>目标丢失：当前目标死亡或离开锁定范围时，平滑切到次优目标而非粗暴解锁。</li>\n<li>镜头插值：切换目标时镜头不瞬移，而是用阻尼插值平滑转向。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>锁定深度耦合摄像机系统：硬锁定时镜头要同时框住玩家与目标，常用「把两者中点放屏幕下方、目标置于上方」的构图。摄像机的运动学与碰撞（防止镜头穿墙）本身是独立课题，本篇只取「锁定向镜头提出的约束」这一面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锁定与攻击导向的耦合\">锁定与攻击导向的耦合</h2><p>锁定不只影响镜头，还要把攻击「掰」向目标。常见技术：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>转向吸附：出招瞬间把角色朝向插值对齐到目标方向，让侧身挥击也能打中。</li>\n<li>位移修正：突进类招式自动调整冲刺距离，停在目标身前的攻击距离上，而非冲过头。</li>\n<li>攻击框扩张：锁定状态下略微放宽<a href=\"../hit-resolution/hitbox-hurtbox-systems\">攻击框</a>的角度容差，弥补玩家瞄准误差。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些「善意修正」和<a href=\"../foundations/input-buffering-responsiveness\">输入缓冲</a>是同一种设计哲学——把玩家略不精确的意图解读成它想要的结果。但要把握分寸：吸附太强会让战斗失去操控感，玩家会觉得「不是我在打，是游戏在帮我打」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ai-视角下的可被锁定性\">AI 视角下的可被锁定性</h2><p>锁定不是单方面的——敌人 AI 也要理解「自己正被锁定」并据此调整行为。被锁定的敌人常会更主动地绕侧、保持距离或做出反制，迫使玩家切换目标或打破锁定。这把锁定系统和<a href=\"ai-combat-encounter\">战斗AI</a>缝在一起：锁定为 AI 提供了「玩家当前焦点」这一关键信息，AI 可据此协调群体——非焦点敌人趁机包抄。多敌环境下「该锁谁、敌人如何利用我的锁定」共同构成了 3D 战斗的空间博弈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>3D 战斗必须解决「打谁」：软锁定每次出招自动导向最优目标、自由度高；硬锁定持续追踪单一目标、掌控感强。</li>\n<li>自动选目标的核心是目标评分函数，综合距离、视角夹角、可见性加权；权重配比是锁定手感的关键。</li>\n<li>目标切换按摇杆方向选下一个，配滞回防抖、平滑插值；锁定深度耦合摄像机构图与运动。</li>\n<li>锁定还把攻击掰向目标（转向吸附、位移修正、攻击框扩张），是「解读玩家意图」哲学的体现，但吸附过强会丧失操控感。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章前置：<a href=\"../hit-resolution/hitbox-hurtbox-systems\">攻击框与受击框系统</a> —— 锁定决定攻击框送向谁。</li>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"ai-combat-encounter\">战斗AI与遭遇设计</a> —— 敌人如何利用玩家的锁定状态协调群体。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-ai/npc-behavior/steering-behaviors\">转向行为</a> —— 被锁定敌人的环绕与走位由转向行为驱动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"锁定与目标选择","id":"锁定与目标选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：软锁定与硬锁定","id":"核心概念-软锁定与硬锁定"},{"level":2,"text":"目标评分：到底该打谁","id":"目标评分-到底该打谁"},{"level":2,"text":"目标切换与镜头协同","id":"目标切换与镜头协同"},{"level":2,"text":"锁定与攻击导向的耦合","id":"锁定与攻击导向的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 视角下的可被锁定性","id":"ai-视角下的可被锁定性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"连招系统设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/systems-depth/combo-system-design"},"next":{"title":"战斗AI与遭遇设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/systems-depth/ai-combat-encounter"}}